WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.774
Stage 7 is your go-live scorecard and daily workflow.

00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:10.481
The readiness scorecard checks identity, knowledge, alerts, bookings, phone and integrations.

00:00:10.481 --> 00:00:16.421
Optional items can stay pending, so you can launch now and add channels at any time.

00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:19.827
When you are ready, click, launch Concierge.

00:00:19.827 --> 00:00:31.536
Then your day lives in four screens: Home for the daily overview, Enquiries and Inbox to reply and take over, Contacts for one timeline per customer, and Bookings and Quotes.

00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:37.035
Every screen also has a ?

00:00:37.035 --> 00:00:36.775
Guide button if you need a reminder.
